      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Sure thing!\n1. Open VRChat in desktop mode (Have not tested in VR yet)\n2. Load into any world\n3. Load into problem avatar completely (2nd avatar blueprint described above)\n4. Switch into any other normal avatar. At this point you should see the 'diamonds' loading avatar in T-Pose at the very least.\n5. Switch into a different avatar after that; assuming the issue occurs, the previous avatar will still be loaded even after the next one loads.",
      "viewerReactions": null
